  "release_changes": "## 🚀 Features\n\n- feat(scan): gate PLAN_TASK on file size (#1252)\n- feat(session): inspect saved sessions by ID from any directory (#1884)\n- feat(rules): add Clojure and ClojureScript review rules (#965)\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: prevent postinstall 404 crash for unreleased v0.0.0 (#1820)\n- fix(telemetry): scope parse and enumerate span contexts to their blocks (#1713)\n- fix(test): add TestMain to isolate cmd/opencodereview from the real home (#1707)\n\n## 🔧 Refactoring\n\n- refactor(runtime): separate review tasks from the shared loop (#1887)\n\n## 📖 Documentation\n\n- docs(readme): state which modes need llm.auth_token (#1778)\n\n## Other Changes\n\n- test(opencode): escape the worktree path in the v2 fallback test (#1846)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/compare/v1.13.6...v1.13.7",
